## Prohibited (general)

- Do NOT invent JWT/OAuth/RBAC requirements when the product has no auth surface
- Do NOT copy web checklist items (XSS, CSP, upload scanning) unless those capabilities exist
- Do NOT disable security validation to “make demos work”

